From d979c40403b533275b414d4dc61073d8d7e8cac7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:58:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Wallpaper redesign, and say what this build actually is

The manuscript wallpapers were ruled notebook paper edge to edge, which
fights icon labels and window text at every size and reads as a very
literal take on "prose". Replaced with a pair rendered by
tools/artwork/artwork.swift (in the HaikuArmQemu repo, so the design is
reproducible): a deep ink field or warm paper, a single broad-nib pen
stroke swelling through the lower third and leaving through the right
edge, fine grain so flat areas keep some life, and a soft vignette. Both
corners stay quiet, because that is where the icons and the Deskbar are.
Tracker's default is the ink one, which suits Haiku's light icon labels.

AboutSystem now opens with what this is: an unofficial, experimental port
of Haiku to Apple Silicon, not affiliated with or supported by the Haiku
project, and not something to report to them as a Haiku bug. It states
plainly that everything which makes this an operating system - the arm64
port, kernel, servers, kits and applications - is the work of the Haiku
developers listed immediately below, and that this fork only adds host
integration for one class of machine.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build/jam/packages/Haiku                      |   4 ++--
 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - ink dark.png   | Bin 0 -> 4790890 bytes
 .../PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png     | Bin 201111 -> 0 bytes
 .../PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png    | Bin 205048 -> 0 bytes
 .../artwork/PROSE wallpaper - paper light.png | Bin 0 -> 2353268 bytes
 src/apps/aboutsystem/AboutSystem.cpp          |  19 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/kits/tracker/TrackerInitialState.cpp      |   2 +-
 7 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - ink dark.png
 delete mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png
 delete mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - paper light.png

diff --git a/build/jam/packages/Haiku b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
index 6ebb5e98a0..2146f81b9c 100644
--- a/build/jam/packages/Haiku
+++ b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
@@ -281,8 +281,8 @@ local logoArtwork =
 	# PROSE fork branding (the wallpaper is the default desktop background,
 	# see TrackerInitialState.cpp)
 	"PROSE logo - paper on ink - big.png"
-	"PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png"
-	"PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png" ;
+	"PROSE wallpaper - ink dark.png"
+	"PROSE wallpaper - paper light.png" ;
 SEARCH on $(logoArtwork) = [ FDirName $(HAIKU_TOP) data artwork ] ;
 AddFilesToPackage data artwork : $(logoArtwork) ;
 
diff --git a/data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - ink dark.png b/data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - ink dark.png
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..547e588d95e54729e00c9a643c9ece8f00264481
GIT binary patch
